{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"no\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"yes\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"The fixed effects were defined as the normalized electrophysiological changes, calculated by:\",\n    \"Percentage Change (%) = (Value_Walk - Value_TurnPre or TurnStart) / Value_Walk × 100\",\n    \"Our analysis revealed that the decreases in the PMC alpha power (β = 0.154, p = 0.035) (Fig. 4A) and increases in PMC-STN alpha coherence (β = 0.205, p = 0.006) (Fig. 4B) during the TurnPre phase, but not the TurnStart phase, significantly predicted the freezing duration within the trial.\",\n    \"Increased PMC-STN alpha coherence during the TurnPre phase (but not during the TurnStart phase) relative to walking predicted shorter freezing episodes (β = 0.205, p = 0.006).\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"The fixed effects were defined as the normalized electrophysiological changes, calculated by:\",\n    \"Percentage Change (%) = (Value_Walk - Value_TurnPre or TurnStart) / Value_Walk × 100\",\n    \"PMC alpha power reduction during the TurnPre phase (but not during the TurnStart phase) relative to walking positively correlated with freezing duration (β = 0.154, p = 0.035)\",\n    \"Increased PMC-STN alpha coherence during the TurnPre phase (but not during the TurnStart phase) relative to walking predicted shorter freezing episodes (β = 0.205, p = 0.006).\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"报告的判断缺乏充分依据，关键问题是没有区分论文中的两种归一化公式。Methods 的 Data normalization and comparison 部分定义了 Normalized Value (%) = Value_Phase / Value_Walk × 100；但在 Statistical analysis 部分，论文明确规定，线性混合效应模型的固定效应使用另一公式，即 Percentage Change (%) = (Value_Walk - Value_TurnPre or TurnStart) / Value_Walk × 100。后一个公式才是解释 β = 0.205 的关键。由于分子方向是 Walk 减 Turn，正系数表示该百分比变化越大，即转弯期 coherence 相对于行走基线越低，预测的冻结持续时间越长。反过来，转弯期 PMC-STN coherence 相对行走基线增加，对应较小或负的百分比变化，因此预测较短的冻结持续时间。这与 Figure 4B 图注的方向完全相容。Figure 4A 中 PMC alpha power 下降与冻结持续时间正相关，也与同一公式及正系数 β = 0.154 相符。此外，Results 正文称 coherence increases predicted freezing duration，但没有明确说是更长还是更短，不能据此认定其与图注矛盾。因此，报告所称的统计方向不一致，实际上忽略了模型自变量的反向百分比编码；指控者的解释有全文依据。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4466fd69-e1fb-4701-8656-3a3c7afd6bfa", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T114758569280Z", "elapsed_seconds": 128.938, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T11:50:07.519771+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a505a95cbb00d23e43cb70b5b46dfa17b4b57a16723c4929342cd38c72638d83", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T114758569280Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "dcb69d33ab53947d06dae589b6366c54